# Loaded by `npm run build` only (production mode).
#
# The deployed API. Redeploy that service whenever you add or change a route:
# the built frontend calls whatever is here, so old server code answers 404 for
# endpoints that exist perfectly well on your machine.
#
# Not a secret — Vite inlines every VITE_* value into the public bundle. Never
# put a password or API key in a VITE_* variable.
VITE_API_URL=https://optidesk-d71l.onrender.com

# Clerk publishable key for your PRODUCTION instance (pk_live_…). A separate Clerk
# instance from development with its own user list, so this is NOT the same value
# as in .env.development. Publishable keys are public; the sk_live_… secret goes in
# the API service's own environment.
#
# Leave it empty and the deployed site keeps working for staff, while /login and
# /signup tell customers sign-in is not configured.
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_Z2FtZS1zYWxtb24tNTQ2OS5jbGVyay5hY2NvdW50cy5kZXYk
